== [A203] correction appended after the run
The TABLE SURVIVED line above is a rehearsal-script defect: under set -o pipefail the
pipeline 'nft list table ... | grep -q' fails on nft's exit 1 even when grep matches.
Checked immediately afterwards:
  sudo nft list tables | grep -c a203_rh -> 0
  sudo nft list table inet a203_rh -> rc 1, stderr: Error: No such file or directory
The runner's nft_table_present() reads the captured stderr of one command (no pipe) and
classifies exactly this reply as absent.
